<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>TAECHANG DEMOLITION</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial;
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

.header{

background:url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503387762-592deb58ef4e");

background-size:cover;

color:white;

padding:100px;

text-align:center;

}

.menu{

background:#111;

padding:15px;

position:sticky;

top:0;

text-align:center;

}

.menu a{

color:white;

margin:20px;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:bold;

}

.section{

padding:60px;

}

.gray{

background:#f4f4f4;

}

.phone{

font-size:28px;

color:red;

font-weight:bold;

}

.contact{

display:flex;

gap:40px;

}

.map{

width:50%;

}

.form{

width:50%;

}

input{

width:100%;

padding:10px;

margin:10px 0;

}

textarea{

width:100%;

height:120px;

padding:10px;

}

button{

background:black;

color:white;

border:0;

padding:15px;

width:100%;

}

.footer{

background:#111;

color:white;

padding:30px;

text-align:center;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="header">

<h1>태창 철거 전문</h1>

<p>상가철거 / 인테리어 철거 / 원상복구</p>

</div>

<div class="menu">

<a href="#about">회사소개</a>

<a href="#service">서비스</a>

<a href="#photo">작업사진</a>

<a href="#contact">문의</a>

</div>

<div id="about" class="section">

<h2>회사소개</h2>

<p>

태창 철거는 상가철거 전문 업체입니다.

합리적인 비용과 빠른 작업으로 상담 가능합니다.

</p>

</div>

<div id="service" class="section gray">

<h2>서비스</h2>

<p>상가철거</p>

<p>부분철거</p>

<p>폐기물 처리</p>

<p>원상복구</p>

</div>

<div id="photo" class="section">

<h2>작업사진</h2>

<p>작업 사진 추가 예정</p>

</div>

<div id="contact" class="section gray">

<h2>문의</h2>

<div class="contact">

<div class="map">

<iframe

src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=대구 달성군 화원읍 화원로7길 68&t=&z=17&output=embed"

width="100%"

height="300"

></iframe>

<p>

대구  
010-XXXX-XXXX

</p>

</div>

<div class="form">

<input placeholder="이름">

<input placeholder="연락처">

<textarea placeholder="문의내용"></textarea>

<button>문의하기</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="footer">

TAECHANG DEMOLITION

</div>

</body>

</html>
